        "uid": "c04c7a9b2f8346bd90c3938b0af8024a",
        "description": "This is a real-time, game-ready model of the iconic SureFire Scout tactical flashlight.\nThe asset was created as part of my hard-surface practice and optimized for use in modern game engines such as Unreal Engine 5 and Unity HDRP.\n\nThe high-poly was modeled and detailed in Blender, baked onto a clean low-poly mesh, and textured using a full PBR workflow (Substance Painter → Marmoset Toolbag).\nAll renders and the turntable here are displayed using Sketchfab’s real-time PBR renderer.\n\n• Technical Details\n\nTris count: 12,146\nTexture sets: 1× 4K\nMaps: Albedo, Roughness, Metallic, Normal (DirectX/OpenGL), Ambient Occlusion\nWorkflow: Metallic/Roughness\nLow Poly: Blender\nHigh Poly: Blender\nBake: Marmoset Toolbag\nTexture: Substance Painter\nEngine Test: Unreal Engine 5\n\n• Features\n\nClean and optimized topology\nHigh-quality normal map bake\nCustom brushed aluminium material\nRealistic micro-detail (knurling, roughness breakup, subtle wear)\nAccurate proportions based on real reference"
      }
